# Copy to .env and fill in. Only the block for the route you're using matters.

# --- local / docker routes: nothing needed, base_url comes from model_router.yaml ---

# --- cloud route: sign in first with `ollama signin` (see ../03-ollama-cloud-opencode.md) ---

# --- vertex_gemma route: no API key, LiteLLM authenticates via Application
#     Default Credentials for the account with access to the project below.
#     endpoint_id/vertex_project/vertex_location are set in model_router.yaml
#     itself, not here, this block is only the auth setup:
#   gcloud auth application-default login --account you@example.com
#   gcloud auth application-default set-quota-project your-project-id
# ADC is a single machine-wide file, switching accounts affects every local
# tool that reads it, not just this demo.
